<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 30.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 30.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    94/95    101/102     UNQ     188/189</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   96/98    103/105   189/192   200/203</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker market was quiet on Friday amid a pre-weekend mood and traders said bunker quotes were likely to stay around their recent levels in the near term. As there are no significant fundamental changes, with demand remaining poor, the market would be slow in the near term, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
